          "title": "You'll want to know: મૃત્યુ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મૃત્યુ — mṛtyu — \"death\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અકસ્માતમાં એક માણસનું મૃત્યુ થયું. akasmātmā̃ ek māṇasnũ mṛtyu thayũ. One man died in the accident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મૃત્યુ (mṛtyu) is a tatsama, Sanskrit mṛtyu, \"death, dying\" (Monier-Williams). It is the word of news reports: તેનું મૃત્યુ થયું, he died."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
